/*selectIdntfcTrprList - Yoo ChiHoon*/ WITH /* itgcm.bizcmmns.cmmns.IdntfcTrprMapper.selectIdntfcTrprList(식별대상자 목록 조회) */ V_IDNTFC_TRPR AS ( SELECT T1.TRPR_INFO_NO AS TRPR_INFO_NO /* 대상자번호*/ , T1.INDV_IDNTFC_NO AS INDV_IDNTFC_NO /* 개인식별번호*/ , T1.UNT_TASKWK_SE_CD AS UNT_TASKWK_SE_CD /* 단위업무구분코드*/ , T2.RRNO_ENCPT AS RRNO_ENCPT /* 주민등록번호암호화*/ , CASE WHEN T1.INDV_IDNTFC_NO IS NOT NULL THEN NVL(T2.FLNM_ENCPT, T1.TRPR_NM_ENCPT) ELSE T1.TRPR_NM_ENCPT END AS TRPR_NM_ENCPT /* 대상자명암호화*/ , CASE WHEN T1.INDV_IDNTFC_NO IS NOT NULL THEN NVL(T2.SXDC_SE_CD, T1.SXDC_SE_CD) ELSE T1.SXDC_SE_CD END AS SXDC_SE_CD /* 성별구분코드*/ , CASE WHEN T1.INDV_IDNTFC_NO IS NOT NULL THEN NVL(T2.MRG_YN, T1.MRG_YN) ELSE T1.MRG_YN END AS MRG_YN /* 결혼여부*/ , CASE WHEN T1.INDV_IDNTFC_NO IS NOT NULL THEN NVL(T2.LAST_ACBG_SE_CD, T1.ACBG_SE_CD) ELSE T1.ACBG_SE_CD END AS ACBG_SE_CD /* 학력구분코드*/ , CASE WHEN T1.INDV_IDNTFC_NO IS NOT NULL THEN NVL(T2.WRD_TELNO, T1.TRPR_TELNO) ELSE T1.TRPR_TELNO END AS TRPR_TELNO /* 대상자전화번호*/ , CASE WHEN T1.INDV_IDNTFC_NO IS NOT NULL THEN NVL(T2.MBL_TELNO_ENCPT, T1.MBL_TELNO_ENCPT) ELSE T1.MBL_TELNO_ENCPT END AS MBL_TELNO_ENCPT /* 휴대전화번호암호화*/ , CASE WHEN T1.INDV_IDNTFC_NO IS NOT NULL THEN NVL(T2.EML_ADDR_ENCPT, T1.EML_ADDR_ENCPT) ELSE T1.EML_ADDR_ENCPT END AS EML_ADDR_ENCPT /* 이메일주소암호화*/ , CASE WHEN T1.INDV_IDNTFC_NO IS NOT NULL THEN NVL(T2.MSNGR_ID_ENCPT, T1.MSNGR_ID_ENCPT) ELSE T1.MSNGR_ID_ENCPT END AS MSNGR_ID_ENCPT /* 메신저아이디암호화*/ , CASE WHEN T1.INDV_IDNTFC_NO IS NOT NULL THEN NVL(T2.ZIP, T1.ZIP) ELSE T1.ZIP END AS ZIP /* 우편번호*/ , CASE WHEN T1.INDV_IDNTFC_NO IS NOT NULL THEN NVL(T2.PST_ADDR, T1.PST_ADDR) ELSE T1.PST_ADDR END AS PST_ADDR /* 우편주소*/ , CASE WHEN T1.INDV_IDNTFC_NO IS NOT NULL THEN NVL(T2.DADDR, T1.DADDR) ELSE T1.DADDR END AS DADDR /* 상세주소*/ , T1.TRPR_BRTH_YMD AS TRPR_BRTH_YMD /* 대상자출생일자*/ , T1.SNS_SE_CD AS SNS_SE_CD /* SNS구분코드*/ , T1.TRPR_USER_ID AS TRPR_USER_ID /* 대상자사용자아이디*/ , T1.GRDTN_STTS_SE_CD AS GRDTN_STTS_SE_CD /* 졸업상태구분코드*/ , T1.GRADE_SE_CD AS GRADE_SE_CD /* 학년구분코드*/ , T1.PSPT_ENG_FLNM_ENCPT AS PSPT_ENG_FLNM_ENCPT /* 여권영문성명암호화*/ , T1.TRPR_BCRN_TYPE_SE_CD AS TRPR_BCRN_TYPE_SE_CD /* 대상자배경유형구분코드*/ , T1.TRPR_BCRN_TYPE_RM_NM AS TRPR_BCRN_TYPE_RM_NM /* 대상자배경유형비고명*/ , T1.NLTY_NTN_SE_CD AS NLTY_NTN_SE_CD /* 국적국가구분코드*/ , T1.ENTCNY_YMD AS ENTCNY_YMD /* 입국일자*/ , T1.BRTH_NTN_SE_CD AS BRTH_NTN_SE_CD /* 출생국가구분코드*/ , T1.GROWTH_NTN_SE_CD AS GROWTH_NTN_SE_CD /* 성장국가구분코드*/ , T1.VISA_TYPE_SE_CD AS VISA_TYPE_SE_CD /* 비자유형구분코드*/ , T1.HANAWO_PENU_NO AS HANAWO_PENU_NO /* 하나원기수번호*/ , T1.RELGN_SE_CD AS RELGN_SE_CD /* 종교구분코드*/ , T1.QLFC_INFO_MNG_NO AS QLFC_INFO_MNG_NO /* 자격정보관리번호*/ , T1.RCPT_PIC_NO AS RCPT_PIC_NO /* 접수기관번호*/ , T1.RCPT_INST_NO AS RCPT_INST_NO /* 접수담당자번호*/ , (SELECT X.INST_NM FROM SAA000 X WHERE X.INST_NO = T1.RCPT_INST_NO) AS RCPT_INST_NM /* 접수기관명*/ , (SELECT X.FLNM_ENCPT FROM SCA100 X WHERE X.ENFSN_NO = T1.RCPT_PIC_NO) AS RCPT_FLNM_ENCPT /* 접수담당자명*/ , (SELECT X.WRD_TELNO FROM SCA100 X WHERE X.ENFSN_NO = T1.RCPT_PIC_NO) AS RCPT_WRD_TELNO /* 접수담당자유선전화번호*/ , (SELECT X.MBL_TELNO_ENCPT FROM SCA100 X WHERE X.ENFSN_NO = T1.RCPT_PIC_NO) AS RCPT_MBL_TELNO_ENCPT /* 접수담당자휴대전화번호*/ , T1.CASE_TRPR_TYPE_SE_CD AS CASE_TRPR_TYPE_SE_CD /* 사례대상자유형구분코드*/ , T1.CASE_MNG_SE_CD AS CASE_MNG_SE_CD /* 사례관리구분코드*/ , T1.CASE_TRPR_SLCTN_YMD AS CASE_TRPR_SLCTN_YMD /* 사례대상자선정일자*/ , T1.CASE_TRPR_UNSL_CS_CN AS CASE_TRPR_UNSL_CS_CN /* 사례대상자미선정사유내용*/ , T1.PRTCR_NM_ENCPT AS PRTCR_NM_ENCPT /* 보호자명암호화*/ , T1.TRPR_REL_SE_CD AS TRPR_REL_SE_CD /* 대상자관계구분코드*/ , T1.LIVTGT_YN AS LIVTGT_YN /* 동거여부*/ , T1.PRTCR_AGRE_YN AS PRTCR_AGRE_YN /* 보호자동의여부*/ , T1.PRVC_PVSN_AGRE_YN AS PRVC_PVSN_AGRE_YN /* 개인정보제공동의여부*/ , T1.SRVC_CTRT_AGRE_YN AS SRVC_CTRT_AGRE_YN /* 서비스계약동의여부*/ , T1.TAG_NM AS TAG_NM /* 태그명*/ , T1.TAG_NO AS TAG_NO /* 태그번호*/ , T1.CASE_TRPR_NOAP_CS_SE_CD AS CASE_TRPR_NOAP_CS_SE_CD /* 사례대상자미신청사유구분코드*/ , T1.PRTCR_TELNO AS PRTCR_TELNO /* 보호자전화번호*/ , T1.PRTCR_MBL_TELNO_ENCPT AS PRTCR_MBL_TELNO_ENCPT /* 보호자휴대전화번호암호화*/ , T1.PRTCR_EML_ADDR_ENCPT AS PRTCR_EML_ADDR_ENCPT /* 보호자이메일주소암호화*/ , T1.PRTCR_ZIP AS PRTCR_ZIP /* 보호자우편번호*/ , T1.PRTCR_PST_ADDR AS PRTCR_PST_ADDR /* 보호자우편주소*/ , T1.PRTCR_DADDR AS PRTCR_DADDR /* 보호자상세주소*/ , T1.RESDN_SHAPE_SE_CD AS RESDN_SHAPE_SE_CD /* 거주형태구분코드*/ , T1.RESIDE_SHAPE_SE_CD AS RESIDE_SHAPE_SE_CD /* 주거형태구분코드*/ , T1.RESIDE_SHAPE_ETC_CN AS RESIDE_SHAPE_ETC_CN /* 주거형태기타내용*/ , T1.FAM_CHAR_SE_CD AS FAM_CHAR_SE_CD /* 가족특성구분코드*/ , T1.INDV_IDNTFC_INFO_UNIPT_CS_CN AS INDV_IDNTFC_INFO_UNIPT_CS_CN /* 개인식별정보미입력사유내용*/ , T1.INDV_IDNTFC_CRTR_YMD AS INDV_IDNTFC_CRTR_YMD /* 개인식별기준일자*/ , T1.PBLAST_SE_CD AS PBLAST_SE_CD , T1.LINK_ADDTNG_DATAA_VALUE1 AS LINK_ADDTNG_DATAA_VALUE1 , T1.LINK_ADDTNG_DATAA_VALUE2 AS LINK_ADDTNG_DATAA_VALUE2 , T1.LINK_ADDTNG_DATAA_VALUE3 AS LINK_ADDTNG_DATAA_VALUE3 , T1.LINK_ADDTNG_DATAA_VALUE4 AS LINK_ADDTNG_DATAA_VALUE4 , T1.LINK_ADDTNG_DATAA_VALUE5 AS LINK_ADDTNG_DATAA_VALUE5 , T1.LINK_ADDTNG_DATAA_VALUE6 AS LINK_ADDTNG_DATAA_VALUE6 , T1.LINK_ADDTNG_DATAA_VALUE7 AS LINK_ADDTNG_DATAA_VALUE7 , T1.LINK_ADDTNG_DATAA_VALUE8 AS LINK_ADDTNG_DATAA_VALUE8 , T1.LINK_ADDTNG_DATAA_VALUE9 AS LINK_ADDTNG_DATAA_VALUE9 , T1.LINK_ADDTNG_DATAA_VALUE10 AS LINK_ADDTNG_DATAA_VALUE10 , T1.LINK_ADDTNG_DATAA_VALUE11 AS LINK_ADDTNG_DATAA_VALUE11 , T1.LINK_ADDTNG_DATAA_VALUE12 AS LINK_ADDTNG_DATAA_VALUE12 , T1.LINK_ADDTNG_DATAA_VALUE13 AS LINK_ADDTNG_DATAA_VALUE13 , T1.LINK_ADDTNG_DATAA_VALUE14 AS LINK_ADDTNG_DATAA_VALUE14 , T1.LINK_ADDTNG_DATAA_VALUE15 AS LINK_ADDTNG_DATAA_VALUE15 , T1.TRPR_PHOTO_ATFINO AS TRPR_PHOTO_ATFINO , T1.PRTCR_BRTH_YMD AS PRTCR_BRTH_YMD , T1.TRMN_CASE_MNG_NO AS TRMN_CASE_MNG_NO , T1.TRMN_CASE_MNG_ODRNO AS TRMN_CASE_MNG_ODRNO , T1.RCPT_RQST_COURS_SE_CD AS RCPT_RQST_COURS_SE_CD , T1.FAM_SHAPE_SE_CD AS FAM_SHAPE_SE_CD , T1.FAM_SHAPE_ETC_CN AS FAM_SHAPE_ETC_CN , T1.FAM_REL_SE_CD AS FAM_REL_SE_CD , T1.FAM_REL_SE_ETC_CN AS FAM_REL_SE_ETC_CN , T1.FAM_CHAR_ETC_CN AS FAM_CHAR_ETC_CN , T1.PRVC_AGRE_YMD AS PRVC_AGRE_YMD , T1.TRPR_REL_ETC_CN AS TRPR_REL_ETC_CN , T1.FAM_CHAR_SE_CD_NM AS FAM_CHAR_SE_CD_NM , T1.RCPT_RQST_COURS_ETC_CN AS RCPT_RQST_COURS_ETC_CN , T1.RCPT_RQST_COURS_DTL_INST_NM AS RCPT_RQST_COURS_DTL_INST_NM , T1.ATFINO AS ATFINO , T1.ORGNL_USER_ID AS ORGNL_USER_ID /* 원본사용자아이디*/ , T1.ORGNL_DSCSN_APLY_CASE_NO AS ORGNL_DSCSN_APLY_CASE_NO /* 원본상담신청사례번호*/ , T1.ORGNL_REQSTD_MNG_NO AS ORGNL_REQSTD_MNG_NO /* 원본신청서관리번호*/ , T1.ORGNL_DSCSN_SN AS ORGNL_DSCSN_SN /* 원본상담일련번호*/ , T1.FRST_RGTR_ID AS FRST_RGTR_ID /* 최초등록자아이디*/ , T1.FRST_REG_DT AS FRST_REG_DT /* 최초등록일시*/ , T1.LAST_MDFR_ID AS LAST_MDFR_ID /* 최종수정자아이디*/ , T1.LAST_MDFCN_DT AS LAST_MDFCN_DT /* 최종수정일시*/ FROM SEA200 T1 , SCA300 T2 WHERE 1 = 1 AND T1.INDV_IDNTFC_NO = T2.INDV_IDNTFC_NO(+) AND T1.DEL_YN = 'N' ) SELECT T.TRPR_INFO_NO AS TRPR_INFO_NO /* 대상자번호*/ , T.INDV_IDNTFC_NO AS INDV_IDNTFC_NO /* 개인식별번호*/ , T.UNT_TASKWK_SE_CD AS UNT_TASKWK_SE_CD /* 단위업무구분코드*/ , C##RG.DEC_B64(T.RRNO_ENCPT) AS RRNO /* 주민등록번호암호화*/ , T.TRPR_BRTH_YMD AS TRPR_BRTH_YMD /* 대상자출생일자*/ , C##RG.DEC_B64(T.TRPR_NM_ENCPT) AS TRPR_NM /* 대상자명암호화*/ , T.SXDC_SE_CD AS SXDC_SE_CD /* 성별구분코드*/ , T.MRG_YN AS MRG_YN /* 결혼여부*/ , T.ACBG_SE_CD AS ACBG_SE_CD /* 학력구분코드*/ , T.TRPR_TELNO AS TRPR_TELNO /* 대상자전화번호*/ , C##RG.DEC_B64(T.MBL_TELNO_ENCPT) AS MBL_TELNO /* 휴대전화번호암호화*/ , C##RG.DEC_B64(T.EML_ADDR_ENCPT) AS EML_ADDR /* 이메일주소암호화*/ , C##RG.DEC_B64(T.MSNGR_ID_ENCPT) AS MSNGR_ID /* 메신저아이디암호화*/ , T.SNS_SE_CD AS SNS_SE_CD /* SNS구분코드*/ , T.ZIP AS ZIP /* 우편번호*/ , T.PST_ADDR AS PST_ADDR /* 우편주소*/ , T.DADDR AS DADDR /* 상세주소*/ , C##RG.DEC_B64(T.RCPT_FLNM_ENCPT) AS RCPT_FLNM , T.RCPT_WRD_TELNO AS RCPT_WRD_TELNO , C##RG.DEC_B64(T.RCPT_MBL_TELNO_ENCPT) AS RCPT_MBL_TELNO , T.RCPT_INST_NM AS RCPT_INST_NM , T.RCPT_PIC_NO AS RCPT_PIC_NO /* 접수기관번호*/ , T.RCPT_INST_NO AS RCPT_INST_NO /* 접수담당자번호*/ , T.CASE_TRPR_TYPE_SE_CD AS CASE_TRPR_TYPE_SE_CD /* 사례대상자유형구분코드*/ /* 대상자이력테이블 저장시 필요컬럼 */ , T.FRST_RGTR_ID AS FRST_RGTR_ID /* 최초등록자아이디*/ , T.FRST_REG_DT AS FRST_REG_DT /* 최초등록일시*/ FROM V_IDNTFC_TRPR T WHERE 1 = 1
AND TRPR_NM_ENCPT = (C##RG.ENC_B64(#{TRPR_NM}))
AND TRPR_BRTH_YMD = #{TRPR_BRTH_YMD}
AND SXDC_SE_CD = #{SXDC_SE_CD}
AND TRPR_TELNO = #{TRPR_TELNO}
AND MBL_TELNO_ENCPT = (C##RG.ENC_B64(#{MBL_TELNO}))
AND EML_ADDR_ENCPT = (C##RG.ENC_B64(#{EML_ADDR}))
AND (SNS_SE_CD = #{SNS_SE_CD} OR MSNGR_ID_ENCPT = (C##RG.ENC_B64(#{MSNGR_ID})))

/*getIdntfcTrprList - Yoo ChiHoon*/ WITH /* itgcm.bizcmmns.cmmns.IdntfcTrprMapper.getIdntfcTrprList(식별대상자 목록 조회) */ V_IDNTFC_TRPR AS ( SELECT T1.TRPR_INFO_NO AS TRPR_INFO_NO /* 대상자번호*/ , T1.INDV_IDNTFC_NO AS INDV_IDNTFC_NO /* 개인식별번호*/ , T1.UNT_TASKWK_SE_CD AS UNT_TASKWK_SE_CD /* 단위업무구분코드*/ , T2.RRNO_ENCPT AS RRNO_ENCPT /* 주민등록번호암호화*/ , CASE WHEN T1.INDV_IDNTFC_NO IS NOT NULL THEN NVL(T2.FLNM_ENCPT, T1.TRPR_NM_ENCPT) ELSE T1.TRPR_NM_ENCPT END AS TRPR_NM_ENCPT /* 대상자명암호화*/ , CASE WHEN T1.INDV_IDNTFC_NO IS NOT NULL THEN NVL(T2.SXDC_SE_CD, T1.SXDC_SE_CD) ELSE T1.SXDC_SE_CD END AS SXDC_SE_CD /* 성별구분코드*/ , CASE WHEN T1.INDV_IDNTFC_NO IS NOT NULL THEN NVL(T2.MRG_YN, T1.MRG_YN) ELSE T1.MRG_YN END AS MRG_YN /* 결혼여부*/ , CASE WHEN T1.INDV_IDNTFC_NO IS NOT NULL THEN NVL(T2.LAST_ACBG_SE_CD, T1.ACBG_SE_CD) ELSE T1.ACBG_SE_CD END AS ACBG_SE_CD /* 학력구분코드*/ , CASE WHEN T1.INDV_IDNTFC_NO IS NOT NULL THEN NVL(T2.WRD_TELNO, T1.TRPR_TELNO) ELSE T1.TRPR_TELNO END AS TRPR_TELNO /* 대상자전화번호*/ , CASE WHEN T1.INDV_IDNTFC_NO IS NOT NULL THEN NVL(T2.MBL_TELNO_ENCPT, T1.MBL_TELNO_ENCPT) ELSE T1.MBL_TELNO_ENCPT END AS MBL_TELNO_ENCPT /* 휴대전화번호암호화*/ , CASE WHEN T1.INDV_IDNTFC_NO IS NOT NULL THEN NVL(T2.EML_ADDR_ENCPT, T1.EML_ADDR_ENCPT) ELSE T1.EML_ADDR_ENCPT END AS EML_ADDR_ENCPT /* 이메일주소암호화*/ , CASE WHEN T1.INDV_IDNTFC_NO IS NOT NULL THEN NVL(T2.MSNGR_ID_ENCPT, T1.MSNGR_ID_ENCPT) ELSE T1.MSNGR_ID_ENCPT END AS MSNGR_ID_ENCPT /* 메신저아이디암호화*/ , CASE WHEN T1.INDV_IDNTFC_NO IS NOT NULL THEN NVL(T2.ZIP, T1.ZIP) ELSE T1.ZIP END AS ZIP /* 우편번호*/ , CASE WHEN T1.INDV_IDNTFC_NO IS NOT NULL THEN NVL(T2.PST_ADDR, T1.PST_ADDR) ELSE T1.PST_ADDR END AS PST_ADDR /* 우편주소*/ , CASE WHEN T1.INDV_IDNTFC_NO IS NOT NULL THEN NVL(T2.DADDR, T1.DADDR) ELSE T1.DADDR END AS DADDR /* 상세주소*/ , T1.TRPR_BRTH_YMD AS TRPR_BRTH_YMD /* 대상자출생일자*/ , T1.SNS_SE_CD AS SNS_SE_CD /* SNS구분코드*/ , T1.TRPR_USER_ID AS TRPR_USER_ID /* 대상자사용자아이디*/ , T1.GRDTN_STTS_SE_CD AS GRDTN_STTS_SE_CD /* 졸업상태구분코드*/ , T1.GRADE_SE_CD AS GRADE_SE_CD /* 학년구분코드*/ , T1.PSPT_ENG_FLNM_ENCPT AS PSPT_ENG_FLNM_ENCPT /* 여권영문성명암호화*/ , T1.TRPR_BCRN_TYPE_SE_CD AS TRPR_BCRN_TYPE_SE_CD /* 대상자배경유형구분코드*/ , T1.TRPR_BCRN_TYPE_RM_NM AS TRPR_BCRN_TYPE_RM_NM /* 대상자배경유형비고명*/ , T1.NLTY_NTN_SE_CD AS NLTY_NTN_SE_CD /* 국적국가구분코드*/ , T1.ENTCNY_YMD AS ENTCNY_YMD /* 입국일자*/ , T1.BRTH_NTN_SE_CD AS BRTH_NTN_SE_CD /* 출생국가구분코드*/ , T1.GROWTH_NTN_SE_CD AS GROWTH_NTN_SE_CD /* 성장국가구분코드*/ , T1.VISA_TYPE_SE_CD AS VISA_TYPE_SE_CD /* 비자유형구분코드*/ , T1.HANAWO_PENU_NO AS HANAWO_PENU_NO /* 하나원기수번호*/ , T1.RELGN_SE_CD AS RELGN_SE_CD /* 종교구분코드*/ , T1.QLFC_INFO_MNG_NO AS QLFC_INFO_MNG_NO /* 자격정보관리번호*/ , T1.RCPT_PIC_NO AS RCPT_PIC_NO /* 접수기관번호*/ , T1.RCPT_INST_NO AS RCPT_INST_NO /* 접수담당자번호*/ , (SELECT X.INST_NM FROM SAA000 X WHERE X.INST_NO = T1.RCPT_INST_NO) AS RCPT_INST_NM /* 접수기관명*/ , (SELECT X.FLNM_ENCPT FROM SCA100 X WHERE X.ENFSN_NO = T1.RCPT_PIC_NO) AS RCPT_FLNM_ENCPT /* 접수담당자명*/ , (SELECT X.WRD_TELNO FROM SCA100 X WHERE X.ENFSN_NO = T1.RCPT_PIC_NO) AS RCPT_WRD_TELNO /* 접수담당자유선전화번호*/ , (SELECT X.MBL_TELNO_ENCPT FROM SCA100 X WHERE X.ENFSN_NO = T1.RCPT_PIC_NO) AS RCPT_MBL_TELNO_ENCPT /* 접수담당자휴대전화번호*/ , T1.CASE_TRPR_TYPE_SE_CD AS CASE_TRPR_TYPE_SE_CD /* 사례대상자유형구분코드*/ , T1.CASE_MNG_SE_CD AS CASE_MNG_SE_CD /* 사례관리구분코드*/ , T1.CASE_TRPR_SLCTN_YMD AS CASE_TRPR_SLCTN_YMD /* 사례대상자선정일자*/ , T1.CASE_TRPR_UNSL_CS_CN AS CASE_TRPR_UNSL_CS_CN /* 사례대상자미선정사유내용*/ , T1.PRTCR_NM_ENCPT AS PRTCR_NM_ENCPT /* 보호자명암호화*/ , T1.TRPR_REL_SE_CD AS TRPR_REL_SE_CD /* 대상자관계구분코드*/ , T1.LIVTGT_YN AS LIVTGT_YN /* 동거여부*/ , T1.PRTCR_AGRE_YN AS PRTCR_AGRE_YN /* 보호자동의여부*/ , T1.PRVC_PVSN_AGRE_YN AS PRVC_PVSN_AGRE_YN /* 개인정보제공동의여부*/ , T1.SRVC_CTRT_AGRE_YN AS SRVC_CTRT_AGRE_YN /* 서비스계약동의여부*/ , T1.TAG_NM AS TAG_NM /* 태그명*/ , T1.TAG_NO AS TAG_NO /* 태그번호*/ , T1.CASE_TRPR_NOAP_CS_SE_CD AS CASE_TRPR_NOAP_CS_SE_CD /* 사례대상자미신청사유구분코드*/ , T1.PRTCR_TELNO AS PRTCR_TELNO /* 보호자전화번호*/ , T1.PRTCR_MBL_TELNO_ENCPT AS PRTCR_MBL_TELNO_ENCPT /* 보호자휴대전화번호암호화*/ , T1.PRTCR_EML_ADDR_ENCPT AS PRTCR_EML_ADDR_ENCPT /* 보호자이메일주소암호화*/ , T1.PRTCR_ZIP AS PRTCR_ZIP /* 보호자우편번호*/ , T1.PRTCR_PST_ADDR AS PRTCR_PST_ADDR /* 보호자우편주소*/ , T1.PRTCR_DADDR AS PRTCR_DADDR /* 보호자상세주소*/ , T1.RESDN_SHAPE_SE_CD AS RESDN_SHAPE_SE_CD /* 거주형태구분코드*/ , T1.RESIDE_SHAPE_SE_CD AS RESIDE_SHAPE_SE_CD /* 주거형태구분코드*/ , T1.RESIDE_SHAPE_ETC_CN AS RESIDE_SHAPE_ETC_CN /* 주거형태기타내용*/ , T1.FAM_CHAR_SE_CD AS FAM_CHAR_SE_CD /* 가족특성구분코드*/ , T1.INDV_IDNTFC_INFO_UNIPT_CS_CN AS INDV_IDNTFC_INFO_UNIPT_CS_CN /* 개인식별정보미입력사유내용*/ , T1.INDV_IDNTFC_CRTR_YMD AS INDV_IDNTFC_CRTR_YMD /* 개인식별기준일자*/ , T1.PBLAST_SE_CD AS PBLAST_SE_CD , T1.LINK_ADDTNG_DATAA_VALUE1 AS LINK_ADDTNG_DATAA_VALUE1 , T1.LINK_ADDTNG_DATAA_VALUE2 AS LINK_ADDTNG_DATAA_VALUE2 , T1.LINK_ADDTNG_DATAA_VALUE3 AS LINK_ADDTNG_DATAA_VALUE3 , T1.LINK_ADDTNG_DATAA_VALUE4 AS LINK_ADDTNG_DATAA_VALUE4 , T1.LINK_ADDTNG_DATAA_VALUE5 AS LINK_ADDTNG_DATAA_VALUE5 , T1.LINK_ADDTNG_DATAA_VALUE6 AS LINK_ADDTNG_DATAA_VALUE6 , T1.LINK_ADDTNG_DATAA_VALUE7 AS LINK_ADDTNG_DATAA_VALUE7 , T1.LINK_ADDTNG_DATAA_VALUE8 AS LINK_ADDTNG_DATAA_VALUE8 , T1.LINK_ADDTNG_DATAA_VALUE9 AS LINK_ADDTNG_DATAA_VALUE9 , T1.LINK_ADDTNG_DATAA_VALUE10 AS LINK_ADDTNG_DATAA_VALUE10 , T1.LINK_ADDTNG_DATAA_VALUE11 AS LINK_ADDTNG_DATAA_VALUE11 , T1.LINK_ADDTNG_DATAA_VALUE12 AS LINK_ADDTNG_DATAA_VALUE12 , T1.LINK_ADDTNG_DATAA_VALUE13 AS LINK_ADDTNG_DATAA_VALUE13 , T1.LINK_ADDTNG_DATAA_VALUE14 AS LINK_ADDTNG_DATAA_VALUE14 , T1.LINK_ADDTNG_DATAA_VALUE15 AS LINK_ADDTNG_DATAA_VALUE15 , T1.TRPR_PHOTO_ATFINO AS TRPR_PHOTO_ATFINO , T1.PRTCR_BRTH_YMD AS PRTCR_BRTH_YMD , T1.TRMN_CASE_MNG_NO AS TRMN_CASE_MNG_NO , T1.TRMN_CASE_MNG_ODRNO AS TRMN_CASE_MNG_ODRNO , T1.RCPT_RQST_COURS_SE_CD AS RCPT_RQST_COURS_SE_CD , T1.FAM_SHAPE_SE_CD AS FAM_SHAPE_SE_CD , T1.FAM_SHAPE_ETC_CN AS FAM_SHAPE_ETC_CN , T1.FAM_REL_SE_CD AS FAM_REL_SE_CD , T1.FAM_REL_SE_ETC_CN AS FAM_REL_SE_ETC_CN , T1.FAM_CHAR_ETC_CN AS FAM_CHAR_ETC_CN , T1.PRVC_AGRE_YMD AS PRVC_AGRE_YMD , T1.TRPR_REL_ETC_CN AS TRPR_REL_ETC_CN , T1.FAM_CHAR_SE_CD_NM AS FAM_CHAR_SE_CD_NM , T1.RCPT_RQST_COURS_ETC_CN AS RCPT_RQST_COURS_ETC_CN , T1.RCPT_RQST_COURS_DTL_INST_NM AS RCPT_RQST_COURS_DTL_INST_NM , T1.ATFINO AS ATFINO , T1.ORGNL_USER_ID AS ORGNL_USER_ID /* 원본사용자아이디*/ , T1.ORGNL_DSCSN_APLY_CASE_NO AS ORGNL_DSCSN_APLY_CASE_NO /* 원본상담신청사례번호*/ , T1.ORGNL_REQSTD_MNG_NO AS ORGNL_REQSTD_MNG_NO /* 원본신청서관리번호*/ , T1.ORGNL_DSCSN_SN AS ORGNL_DSCSN_SN /* 원본상담일련번호*/ , T1.FRST_RGTR_ID AS FRST_RGTR_ID /* 최초등록자아이디*/ , T1.FRST_REG_DT AS FRST_REG_DT /* 최초등록일시*/ , T1.LAST_MDFR_ID AS LAST_MDFR_ID /* 최종수정자아이디*/ , T1.LAST_MDFCN_DT AS LAST_MDFCN_DT /* 최종수정일시*/ FROM SEA200 T1 , SCA300 T2 WHERE 1 = 1 AND T1.INDV_IDNTFC_NO = T2.INDV_IDNTFC_NO(+) AND T1.DEL_YN = 'N' ), SEARCH_LIST AS ( SELECT T.TRPR_INFO_NO AS TRPR_INFO_NO /* 대상자번호*/ , T.INDV_IDNTFC_NO AS INDV_IDNTFC_NO /* 개인식별번호*/ , T.UNT_TASKWK_SE_CD AS UNT_TASKWK_SE_CD /* 단위업무구분코드*/ , T.RRNO_ENCPT AS RRNO_ENCPT /* 주민등록번호암호화*/ , T.TRPR_BRTH_YMD AS TRPR_BRTH_YMD /* 대상자출생일자*/ , T.TRPR_NM_ENCPT AS TRPR_NM_ENCPT /* 대상자명암호화*/ , T.SXDC_SE_CD AS SXDC_SE_CD /* 성별구분코드*/ , T.MRG_YN AS MRG_YN /* 결혼여부*/ , T.ACBG_SE_CD AS ACBG_SE_CD /* 학력구분코드*/ , T.TRPR_TELNO AS TRPR_TELNO /* 대상자전화번호*/ , T.MBL_TELNO_ENCPT AS MBL_TELNO_ENCPT /* 휴대전화번호암호화*/ , T.EML_ADDR_ENCPT AS EML_ADDR_ENCPT /* 이메일주소암호화*/ , T.MSNGR_ID_ENCPT AS MSNGR_ID_ENCPT /* 메신저아이디암호화*/ , T.SNS_SE_CD AS SNS_SE_CD /* SNS구분코드*/ , T.ZIP AS ZIP /* 우편번호*/ , T.PST_ADDR AS PST_ADDR /* 우편주소*/ , T.DADDR AS DADDR /* 상세주소*/ , T.RCPT_FLNM_ENCPT AS RCPT_FLNM_ENCPT , T.RCPT_WRD_TELNO AS RCPT_WRD_TELNO , T.RCPT_MBL_TELNO_ENCPT AS RCPT_MBL_TELNO_ENCPT , T.RCPT_INST_NM AS RCPT_INST_NM , T.CASE_TRPR_TYPE_SE_CD AS CASE_TRPR_TYPE_SE_CD /* 사례대상자유형구분코드*/ /* 대상자이력테이블 저장시 필요컬럼 */ , T.FRST_RGTR_ID AS FRST_RGTR_ID /* 최초등록자아이디*/ , T.FRST_REG_DT AS FRST_REG_DT /* 최초등록일시*/ FROM V_IDNTFC_TRPR T WHERE 1 = 1 AND TRPR_INFO_NO NOT IN (#{TRPR_INFO_NO})
AND TRPR_NM_ENCPT = #{TRPR_NM_ENCPT}
AND TRPR_BRTH_YMD = #{TRPR_BRTH_YMD}
AND SXDC_SE_CD = #{SXDC_SE_CD}
) SELECT COUNT(*) AS CNT FROM SEARCH_LIST
